  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 -  The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 17 June 2024, the use of 2 Spring Grove Road TW3 4BJ as two self-contained flats is not lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\nThe applicant has failed to submit sufficient information to evidence that, on the balance of probabilities, the property has been in use as two self-contained units for the continuous period of four years.\r\n"
